      "widgets_values": [
        "For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] 2D-animated, flat painterly shapes with soft brush-textured color, muted grey-blue buildings, and bright neon accents. A low-angle shot shows the narrow alley from <Picture 1>, preserving the shuttered shops, wall-mounted air conditioners, the utility pole with tangled cables, the purple, green, and yellow neon signs, the red vending machine, and the stacked plastic crates. The boy with messy black hair, a white T-shirt, dark shorts, a black shoulder bag, and white sneakers stands on the right side of the frame with his back to the camera. At the far end of the alley, the giant grey and red robot with a glowing yellow visor towers between the skyscrapers. The boy takes a few slow steps backward toward the camera, and the camera pulls out with small amplitude at slow speed, keeping pace with him. In the distance, the robot strides forward with heavy steps. A building behind it crumbles, and thick clouds of dust roll out into the alley. With each of the robot's steps and each collapse, the neon signs and street lights flicker on and off. The boy turns around to face the camera, his eyes wide and his mouth open in panic, then sprints toward the camera and runs past it out of the frame. The moment he starts running, the camera stops and holds a static shot as the robot keeps advancing through the dust.\n\noverall_soundscape: Deep metallic thuds from the robot's footsteps shake the alley, followed by the rumble of collapsing concrete and scattering debris. Neon tubes buzz and crackle as they flicker, while the boy's sneakers scuff the wet pavement and his quick panting grows louder as he runs past.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A low pulsing synth bass with deep drum hits at a slow tempo, quickening and rising in volume as the boy starts to run.",
